   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Hello all,<br>\n<br>\nHere is a very simple question form a novice.<br><br>\n</span></font><div><font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">How can I change the appearance of the axes in ggplot? <br>\n<br>\nThe closest I could get to the basic R graphics appearance is by using <br>\n<br>\n</span></font><font size=\"1\"><font face=\"Menlo Regular\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt\"><b>opts(axis.line = theme_segment())</b><br>\n</span></font><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt\"><font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><br>\n</font></span></font><font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Still very unpleasant!<br>\n<br>\nThanks for you comments,<br>\nRobert</span></font>\n</div>\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
