   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Robert,<div><br></div><div>I am learning all this too just now. Here is the<a href=\"http://www.google.co.uk/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=ggplot2.pdf&amp;source=web&amp;cd=1&amp;ved=0CCYQFjAA&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fcran.r-project.org%2Fweb%2Fpackages%2Fggplot2%2Fggplot2.pdf&amp;ei=EkVVT8vgGMKaiQLmttGzBg&amp;usg=AFQjCNEgszqvCMtt5NQNsJ0UAWBK_kt0gw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.google.co.uk/url?sa%3Dt%26rct%3Dj%26q%3Dggplot2.pdf%26source%3Dweb%26cd%3D1%26ved%3D0CCYQFjAA%26url%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fcran.r-project.org%252Fweb%252Fpackages%252Fggplot2%252Fggplot2.pdf%26ei%3DEkVVT8vgGMKaiQLmttGzBg%26usg%3DAFQjCNEgszqvCMtt5NQNsJ0UAWBK_kt0gw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792376660184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CJzhgjOFrCS4Uli-zVbZM\"> link to the package documentation</a> which I found really useful.</div>\n<div><br></div><div>Check theme_get() and theme_set() which seem to be used for setting style themes, and include object $axis represneting many axis styles (such as tick color, tick lenght etc). </div><div><br></div><div>\nHope that helps.</div><div><br></div><div>Stefan</div><div><br></div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
